          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the Fight phase, each enemy Character unit within 6&quot; of this model must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from that test when they do. In addition, each time this model destroys an enemy Character model with a melee attack, you gain 1CP.</characteristic>
